#############################
# 3D mesher (fTetWild) debug output
#############################

# fTetWild writes __tracked_surface.stl to the working directory on every
# 3D mesh run. MeshWorker.cpp now keeps it in the temp job folder; this
# stops a stray copy from being committed again.
*_tracked_surface.stl

#############################
# Installer builds
#############################

# Uncomment to stop committing new installers (attach them to GitHub
# Releases instead). Installers already in the repo stay tracked until
# removed with: git rm -r --cached Mould3r/Mould3r/Mould3r/installer/Output
# **/installer/Output/
